<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson signs 2.2 bln skr contract.</title>
<headline>Ericsson signs 2.2 bln skr contract.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms firm LM Ericsson AB said on Monday it had signed a three-year mobile telephone contract with Britain's Vodafone worth 2.2 billion crowns ($331.2 million). ($ = 6.642 Swedish Crowns)</p>
</text>
